# seq?: returns true for a Seq.Cons value (not a Dict, not a Variant with other tag)
# Regression: seq? uses [match x Seq: true _: false] — TypeTag "Seq" must match Seq.Cons
# After migration type_name() returns "Variant" for Seq.Cons, so TypeTag("Seq") may fail.
# This test catches that regression.
[seq? [range 1 4]]
=== out
Bool(true)
